BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:2026 Ocean State Rhode Races - Marathon\, Half Marathon and 5k
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTSTAMP:20261025T143341Z
UID:ee431aa342e639190043a7943e5c@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The 9th Annual Ocean State Rhode Races in Narragansett\, RI wi
 ll be held on Sunday\, October 25\, 2026. Race weekend features a Marathon
 \, Half Marathon\, and 5k Race. The Marathon will start at 7:30 am\, the H
 alf Marathon will start at 8:00 AM\, and the 5k at 8:15 am\, all on Sunday
 . This boutique Rhode Island marathon will showcase what is great about th
 e Ocean State. Not only does the course feature classic Rhode Island beaut
 y\, our post-race festival will include an authentic RI experience at icon
 ic Narragansett Town Beach. For runners and by runners\, the event offers 
 direct access to the race directors who promise timely communication and p
 ersonal touches throughout your race experience. URLs: Facebook: https://g
 o.evvnt.com/3346151-2?pid=10404 Instagram: https://go.evvnt.com/3346151-3?
 pid=10404 YouTube: https://go.evvnt.com/3346151-4?pid=10404 Date and Time:
  On Sun\, 25 Oct 2026 07:30 - Sun\, 25 Oct 2026 13:30 Venue details: Narra
 gansett Town Beach\, 39 Boston Neck Road\, Narragansett\, Rhode Island\, 0
 2882\, United States Category: Sports / Leisure | Running Price: Entry Fee
 s start at: USD 25.00\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/20
 26-ocean-state-rhode-races-marathon-half-marathon-and-5k/107684/
LOCATION:Narragansett Town Beach\, 39 Boston Neck Road\, Narragansett\, RI
 \, 02882
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/2026-ocean-state-rhode-races-ma
 rathon-half-marathon-and-5k/107684/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:43rd Annual Taste of Newport
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTSTAMP:20261025T143341Z
UID:79e6b141a8a484d21961e5ab06a2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:The wait is over. Taste of Newport is back and better than eve
 r! Join us at the Newport Marriott Hotel &amp\; Spa for an unforgettable e
 vening celebrating Rhode Island's vibrant culinary scene while supporting 
 Child &amp\; Family. Indulge in unlimited tastings from some of the region
 's top restaurants\, wineries\, breweries\, and beverage partners. Enjoy l
 ive entertainment\, bid on exciting items in our Silent Auction\, and take
  your chance in our much-loved Wine Raffle. For more than 160 years\, Chil
 d &amp\; Family has helped children\, families\, and older adults build st
 ronger\, healthier futures through compassionate community-based programs.
  Every ticket purchased helps support these life-changing services right h
 ere in Rhode Island. Come hungry\, bring your friends\, and join us for an
  evening of great food\, drinks\, entertainment\, and community impact. 
 📅 Sunday\, October 25 🕠 5:30 PM - 8:00 PM 📍 Newport Marriott Hote
 l &amp\; Spa 🎟️ Tickets: https://onecau.se/_n2rt41 We are incredibly 
 grateful to this year’s sponsors thus far for helping make Taste of Newp
 ort possible: Aramli Foundation and BedJet • BankNewport • Delta Denta
 l • Family Service of Rhode Island (FSRI) • Bowen’s Wharf • DBS Bu
 ilding Solutions • Secure Networks • People’s Credit Union • Saccu
 cci Honda • Hilb Group • Beeline • Rippling • Newport Marriott Hot
 el &amp\; Spa • Centreville Bank • Figure It Out Today • Regan Heati
 ng &amp\; Air • World Insurance Associates • Eastern Bank • Edward J
 ones • FJ Scott Painting • Mancini Beverages Interested in being part 
 of Taste of Newport? Restaurants\, caterers\, beverage partners\, and orga
 nizations interested in participating or supporting the event can learn mo
 re at https://lnkd.in/g27WFW4N Taste. Celebrate. Make a Difference. ❤️
 \n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/43rd-annual-taste-of-ne
 wport/112123/
LOCATION:Newport Marriot & Spa\, 25 America's Cup Ave\, Newport\, RI 02840
 \, Newport\, 02840
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/43rd-annual-taste-of-newport/11
 2123/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A New England Thanksgiving
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTSTAMP:20261025T143341Z
UID:3cd0eb43e4347b6d8aa62ae9c565@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Join the Coggeshall staff as we prepare a Thanksgiving meal ov
 er the hearth in our historic farmhouse. The late 18th century was before 
 the official start of Thanksgiving as a national holiday\, but the day was
  still celebrated with food and prayer in New England. Watch our costumed 
 historians make chicken on a string\, bake a pie in the hot coals\, mash t
 urnips and churn butter. In the woodshop we will also demonstrate carving 
 wooden spoons. Explore the garden to see the last of the fall harvest. Wal
 k the nature trail and look for signs of wild turkey\, see musket demonstr
 ations and try your aim with rubber band targets. Please note: This is not
  a Thanksgiving meal for visitors to eat. Food prepared in the historic Fa
 rmhouse Kitchen does not meet modern health and food preparation codes for
  public consumption.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-n
 ew-england-thanksgiving/112116/
LOCATION:Coggeshall Farm Museum\, 1 Colt Drive\, Bristol\, 02809 Time: 10:
 00 AM to 4:00 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/a-new-england-thanksgiving/1121
 16/
END:VEVENT
